<title>UK: UK estates considering Ashquay bid.</title>
<headline>UK estates considering Ashquay bid.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>UK Estates Plc said on Thursday that it was considering an offer from Ashquay Group Plc, but was advising shareholders to take no action at present.</p>
<p>The company, which owns retail and office property investments, said it would issue a further announcment in due course.</p>
<p>Ashquay said earlier it was making a share offer for UK Estates which valued the company at 21.1 million stg. It is offering 10 offer shares for every 13 UK Estates ordinary shares.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
